# Small modules

- Keep packages and functions small, with a single clear responsibility.
- Prefer splitting into focused files over growing one large file.
- Follow [project-structure](project-structure.mdc): features under `internal/<feature>`, TUI in `internal/ui`, shared code only as named packages when reused.
- Extract a helper into its own file in the **same** feature package first; promote only on a second caller.
